 "equipment_type": "Power meter",
 "applies_to": "Enercept H8035 (energy only) and H8036 (enhanced data stream) split-core three-phase power transducers, 100-2400 A, installation guide Z201686-0K.",
 "summary": "The Veris Enercept H8035/H8036 is a three-phase power transducer with integral split-core CTs and an RS-485 Modbus RTU port, addressed by DIP switches (1-63). Every data point is offered twice: as a scaled integer from 40001 and as an IEEE 754 float from 40257. This map lists the float block, which needs no model-dependent multiplier; the H8035 provides energy and real power only.",
